Find Easy - Hidden Differences is a new amazing kind of puzzle games!
Find the differences between two similar pictures. To understand where the differences are hidden, you need to focus a little, which will  also help you to develop attention, memory and logical thinking and have a wonderful time.
Playing through the levels of the game will definitely not let you get bored, because we did our best and made beautiful, bright pictures.
To test your attentiveness, you have to find the difference between two seemingly identical images, look for the differences until the time runs out!
Why Everyone should Play Find Easy - Hidden Differences:
- Solving puzzles, you will learn to see the differences like an expert;
- Active development of cognitive abilities for people of any age group and as a bonus you`ll get excellent memory and mental flexibility;
- Zoom system for easy search;
 - Hints on each level;
- Our beautiful art and pleasant music
Play and enjoy!
